## Appended by Stage 2a-2, 2026-09-13: corpus_2026-09-13b, the final corpus

`corpus_2026-09-13b` is the corpus Stage 2b should use. 10,000 datasets plus a
50-dataset probe set, seed 42, 0 failed parents, 0 rejected by the validity
filter, 847 s. It is the first corpus generated with both arms cleaned by the
same multiplicative log-space rule, with bounded-density components, and with
the overlap solve targeting the minimum ADJACENT pairwise overlap.

Match against the 136 empirical datasets: mean standardized W1 across the ten
characteristics 0.275, and the VISIBLE mode distribution matching to a total
variation of 0.007 (95.5 percent of synthetic datasets have one visible mode
against an empirical 94.9).

The earlier corpora of this stage are superseded and were all built with at
least one defect since fixed. They stay on disk only as the record of the
search: corpus_2026-09-12c (average-overlap target, additive truncation),
and the 1,000-dataset drafts d, e, f, g, h and 2026-09-13a.

